# Preserve the historical handoff's quoted upstream patch byte-for-byte.
experiments/handwriting/2026-09-14/HANDOFF.md -whitespace
# Unified-diff context represents an empty source line with one space.

# Font binaries must NEVER be committed (rule of 2026-09-17, docs/fonts/README.md
# "Standing rules"; attributes added 2026-10-22). The bytes live in tarballs on
# the NAS M.2 and enter the store through requireFile in pkgs/*.nix. .gitignore
# refuses these extensions; tools/fonts/check-no-font-bytes.sh fails on them by
# extension and by magic header. These lines only keep git from diffing or
# merging a font that was forced in anyway: they are not permission to add one.
*.ttf -diff -merge
*.otf -diff -merge
*.ttc -diff -merge
*.pfb -diff -merge
*.woff -diff -merge
*.woff2 -diff -merge
